(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Apple has truly outdone itself. The MacBook Air M4 is a powerhouse packed into an ultra-light chassis. From its blazing-fast performance and vibrant display to its crystal-clear audio and all-day battery life—every detail screams premium. Whether you're working on the go or relaxing with a movie, it delivers flawlessly. The Sky Blue finish adds a sleek, modern touch. This device is not just a laptop, it's a statement.

